{"id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-topos.md","title":"Elementary and Grothendieck Topos","display":"df-topos — Elementary and Grothendieck Topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-topos","aliases":["58-df-topos","Topos"],"display":"df-topos — Elementary and Grothendieck Topos","depends_on":["[[58-df-category]]","[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-terminal-object]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-pullback]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-monomorphism]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-topos</span><span>Topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-topos — Elementary and Grothendieck Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e957906c5913d561\" href=\"?note=e957906c5913d561\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-terminal-object\">58-df-zfc-cat-terminal-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4922f5599894afb1\" href=\"?note=4922f5599894afb1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-pullback\">58-df-zfc-cat-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"10d1013ea2b50503\" href=\"?note=10d1013ea2b50503\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-monomorphism\">58-df-zfc-cat-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6477de4a04201a72\" href=\"?note=6477de4a04201a72\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category\">58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35170dc430c7d67b\" href=\"?note=35170dc430c7d67b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76fcf4f967d128d9\" href=\"?note=76fcf4f967d128d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe\">58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"429dd2b96f81efcc\" href=\"?note=429dd2b96f81efcc\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category\">58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is a Grothendieck universe and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal C\\)</span> are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small category data.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(1,\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{true}\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{true}\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> are candidates for a terminal object, a classifier, and its truth arrow.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>, identities, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> are the projections and operations of a set-coded category datum.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For a presheaf code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(C)\">\\(F(C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> denote its object and arrow components, with the latter evaluated as the set-function encoded by the corresponding arrow of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_U\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_U\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonomorphism}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S\\)</span> is supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35170dc430c7d67b\" href=\"?note=35170dc430c7d67b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Site}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Site}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Topos}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Topos}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land A,B,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land\np_A\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(P,A)\\land p_B\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(P,B)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,A)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,B)\\;\n\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,P)\\;(p_A\\circ u=f\\land p_B\\circ u=g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land A,B,P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land\np_A\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(P,A)\\land p_B\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(P,B)\\land\n\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,A)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,B)\\;\n\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,P)\\;(p_A\\circ u=f\\land p_B\\circ u=g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}finite\\text{-}limits}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists1\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S(1,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,C)\\;\\exists P,p_A,p_B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,C,f,g,\\mathcal E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}finite\\text{-}limits}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists1\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S(1,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(A,C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(B,C)\\;\\exists P,p_A,p_B\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(P,p_A,p_B,A,B,C,f,g,\\mathcal E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}exponentials}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\n\\exists B^A,E_A,p_1,p_2,\\operatorname{ev}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(E_A,p_1,p_2,B^A,A,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(E_A,B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall Q,q_X,q_A\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(Q,q_X,q_A,X,A,\\mathcal E)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,B)\\;\\exists!\\ell\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,B^A)\\;\n\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,E_A)\\;\\bigl(\np_1\\circ u=\\ell\\circ q_X\\land p_2\\circ u=q_A\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\circ u=h\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}exponentials}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\n\\exists B^A,E_A,p_1,p_2,\\operatorname{ev}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(E_A,p_1,p_2,B^A,A,\\mathcal E)\n\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(E_A,B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall Q,q_X,q_A\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ProductObject}_S(Q,q_X,q_A,X,A,\\mathcal E)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,B)\\;\\exists!\\ell\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,B^A)\\;\n\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,E_A)\\;\\bigl(\np_1\\circ u=\\ell\\circ q_X\\land p_2\\circ u=q_A\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\circ u=h\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}classifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S(\\Omega,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists1\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S(1,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{true}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega)\\land\n\\forall S,X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,X)\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonomorphism}_S(m,\\mathcal E)\\to\n\\exists!\\chi_m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega)\\;\\exists u_S\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,1)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(S,m,u_S,X,1,\\Omega,\\chi_m,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}classifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S(\\Omega,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists1\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCatTerminalObject}_S(1,\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{true}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(1,\\Omega)\\land\n\\forall S,X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,X)\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatMonomorphism}_S(m,\\mathcal E)\\to\n\\exists!\\chi_m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,\\Omega)\\;\\exists u_S\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S,1)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatPullback}_S(S,m,u_S,X,1,\\Omega,\\chi_m,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Topos}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathrm{true}\\;\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S(\\Omega,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}elementary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Topos}_S(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteLimits}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{Exponentials}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\exists\\Omega,\\mathrm{true}\\;\\mathrm{SubobjectClassifier}_S(\\Omega,\\mathrm{true},\\mathcal E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\nR\\subseteq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,C)\\land\n\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(E,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;(f\\circ g\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\nR\\subseteq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,C)\\land\n\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(E,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;(f\\circ g\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}pullback\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R_f,R,f,D,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\nf\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\nR_f=\\{g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,D):f\\circ g\\in R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}pullback\\text{-}sieve}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R_f,R,f,D,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land\nf\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\nR_f=\\{g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,D):f\\circ g\\in R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}grothendieck\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(J,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\\right)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,C)\\in J(C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\;\n\\exists R_f\\;(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R_f,R,f,D,C,\\mathcal C)\\land R_f\\in J(D))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\forall S\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(S,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall f\\in R\\;\\exists S_f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(S_f,S,f,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f),C,\\mathcal C)\\land\nS_f\\in J(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\bigr)\\to S\\in J(C)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}grothendieck\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(J,\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\\right)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,C)\\in J(C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(R,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\;\n\\exists R_f\\;(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(R_f,R,f,D,C,\\mathcal C)\\land R_f\\in J(D))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\forall S\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoricalSieve}_S(S,C,\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\forall f\\in R\\;\\exists S_f\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PullbackSieve}_S(S_f,S,f,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f),C,\\mathcal C)\\land\nS_f\\in J(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\bigr)\\to S\\in J(C)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}site}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\\land\\mathcal C\\in U\\land\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}site}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcCatGrothendieckUniverse}_S(U)\\land\\mathcal C\\in U\\land\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopology}_S(J,\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\exists\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\land\nF\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\forall a\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(a,R,\\bigcup_{f\\in R}F(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;a(f)\\in F(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(E,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;\n(a(f\\circ g)=F(g)(a(f)))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists!x\\in F(C)\\;\\forall f\\in R\\;(F(f)(x)=a(f))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}site\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\exists\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\land\nF\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U)\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall R\\in J(C)\\;\\forall a\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(a,R,\\bigcup_{f\\in R}F(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;a(f)\\in F(\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f\\in R\\;\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(E,\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\;\n(a(f\\circ g)=F(g)(a(f)))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists!x\\in F(C)\\;\\forall f\\in R\\;(F(f)(x)=a(f))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\\exists\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal S)=\\{F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U):\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\\exists\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCatPresheafCategory}_S(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U,\\mathcal C,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal S)=\\{F\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}_U):\\mathrm{SiteSheaf}_S(F,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}grothendieck}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal S,Q\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S(Q,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal S)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}topos\\text{-}grothendieck}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal E)\\land\\exists\\mathcal C,J,\\mathcal S,Q\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Site}_S(\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{SheafCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,J,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S(Q,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal S)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite limits are reduced to a terminal object and pullbacks; every object and arrow in the product, exponential, and classifier clauses is now bound through the category's object and hom sets.</li>\n<li>A Grothendieck topology is defined through maximality, pullback stability, and transitivity of categorical sieves.</li>\n<li>The site-sheaf condition is expanded as existence and uniqueness of amalgamations for compatible matching families, and the sheaf category is an explicit full subcategory of the registered presheaf category.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane and Moerdijk, Sheaves in Geometry and Logic</li>\n<li>Johnstone, Sketches of an Elephant</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-terminal-object","status":"resolved","id":"e957906c5913d561","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-terminal-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"4922f5599894afb1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"10d1013ea2b50503","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category","status":"resolved","id":"6477de4a04201a72","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"35170dc430c7d67b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe","status":"resolved","id":"76fcf4f967d128d9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"429dd2b96f81efcc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"35170dc430c7d67b","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullSubcategory}_S$ is supplied by [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-cat2-full-subcategory]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E,\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"1,\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{true}\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C):\\operatorname{src}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land\\operatorname{tgt}_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,B)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F(C)","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_U","d